@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333/api

### A API está viva?
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ======== LOGINS ========

### Login do admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@wiaflow.local",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

### Login da Ana (vendedora)
# @name loginAna
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@wiaflow.local",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@tokenAna = {{loginAna.response.body.accessToken}}

### Quem sou eu? (-> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ======== USUÁRIOS E ESTÁGIOS ========

### Listar usuários (ADMIN -> 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ana tenta listar usuários (-> 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### Estágios (-> 200; usado nos testes de mover)
# @name stages
GET {{baseUrl}}/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### ======== CONVERSAS (Passo 16) ========

### ADMIN lista todas (-> 8)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Busca por nome (-> só Mariana)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations?search=mari
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Busca por telefone (-> só Felipe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations?search=1991207788
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ana lista as dela (-> 4)
# @name convAna
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### Ana abre uma conversa dela (-> 200 com mensagens)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### Conversa que não existe (-> 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/id-que-nao-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ======== MOVER, ATRIBUIR, EDITAR (Passo 17) ========

### Ana move a 1ª conversa dela para "Proposta enviada" (-> 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageId": "{{stages.response.body.$[2].id}}"
}

### Histórico da conversa (-> a mudança aparece no topo, com o nome da Ana)
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}

### Ana edita o valor estimado (-> 200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estimatedValue": 3500.50
}

### Ana tenta atribuir (VENDEDOR não pode -> 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedToId": null
}

### Estágio inválido (-> 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{convAna.response.body.$[0].id}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageId": "estagio-que-nao-existe"
}

